 2\,000m\; note the race-pace feel in each rep.\n\nReason: Open-water data 
 shows current pace is 28–31 min/km vs the 2:30/100m race target\; a stru
 ctured 100m pace-rep set this week is the single highest-value session bef
 ore taper begins.\n\nAI coaching 2026-09-19
